{{!
    @template mod_thesesynthesis/navlinks

    Liens vers les pages de l'activité de suivi, déjà filtrés selon les capacités de l'utilisateur.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * buttons Contexte de mod_these/actions.
    * settings Contexte de mod_these/settings_menu (pages de paramétrage), ou false.

    Example context (json):
    {"buttons": {"actions": [
        {"label": "Tableau de bord", "url": "https://example.com/mod/thesesynthesis/view.php?id=2",
            "class": "btn btn-secondary mr-1 mb-1"},
        {"label": "Planning des soutenances", "url": "https://example.com/mod/thesesynthesis/planning.php?id=2",
            "class": "btn btn-secondary mr-1 mb-1"}
    ]}, "settings": false }
}}
<div class="these-navlinks mb-3">{{#buttons}}{{> mod_these/actions}}{{/buttons}}{{#settings}}{{> mod_these/settings_menu}}{{/settings}}</div>
